# APEPE Governance Witness

This public repository contains governance witness records for the private APEPE research repository.

It must not contain:
- trading strategies
- source code
- market datasets
- private research results
- PnL details
- credentials or secrets

It may contain:
- opaque hashes
- approval records
- preregistration seals
- governance attestations
- references to private commit SHAs

